{"type":"message","id":"1d0eba20","parentId":"c6e92abc","timestamp":"2026-04-08T22:12:14.779Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"[cron:488d025f-33cc-4322-8bcb-feba06471bf1 每日行业信息搜索] 执行外网搜索任务：\n1. 搜索酒店行业最新动态（携程、美团、飞猪等）\n2. 搜索AI Agent最新技术/产品\n3. 搜索德拢集团相关新闻\n4. 提炼3条最重要信息\n5. 更新到 memory/2026-04-07.md\n\n目标：保持对行业动态的持续关注\nCurrent time: Thursday, April 9th, 2026 - 6:11 AM (Asia/Shanghai) / 2026-04-08 22:11 UTC\n\nReturn your summary as plain text; it will be delivered automatically. If the task explicitly calls for messaging a specific external recipient, note who/where it should go instead of sending it yourself."}],"timestamp":1775686334724}}
